<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>RuneScape</title>

    <meta charset="utf-8">

    <style>
        body,
        td,
        p {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: white;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0px 0px;
            overflow: auto;
            background-color: black;
        }

        center {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        a {
            color: #90b8e0;
        }

        .panel {
            max-width: 560px;
            text-align: left;
            border: 1px solid #382418;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            background-color: #101010;
        }

        code {
            font-family: Consolas, monospace;
            color: #c8e0a0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <center>
        <div class="panel">
            <h2>RuneScape &mdash; revision 647 (May 2011)</h2>
            <p>
                Revision 647 has no browser port &mdash; it plays through the
                deobfuscated Java desktop client, which streams the cache from
                this server over JS5.
            </p>
            <p>
                1. <a href="/client.jar">Download client.jar</a>
                (requires Java 11+)
            </p>
            <p>
                2. The client fetches its configuration from
                <code>http://127.0.0.1/jav_config.ws</code>, so this server's
                HTTP listener must be on port 80:
            </p>
            <p><code>cargo run -p rs-server -- --http-port 80</code></p>
            <p>
                3. Launch the client (world <%= nodeid %>):
            </p>
            <p><code>java -jar client.jar</code></p>
            <p>
                Log in with any username and password &mdash; accounts are
                created on first login.
            </p>
        </div>
    </center>
</body>

</html>
